    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Essential User Rights is a lightweight plugin that helps you manage user permissions effortlessly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Restrict editors to specific pages</li>\n<li>Limit media library access to a user&#8217;s own uploads</li>\n<li>No complex setup – just install and configure</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for WordPress sites where content management needs to be controlled without unnecessary complexity.</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed by <a href=\"https://stephanwagner.me\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stephan Wagner</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>essential-user-rights</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 6.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Easily manage user permissions in WordPress. Restrict editors to specific pages and media. Simple setup - install, configure, and go!",
    "description": "<p>Essential User Rights is a lightweight plugin that helps you manage user permissions effortlessly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Restrict editors to specific pages</li>\n<li>Limit media library access to a user&#8217;s own uploads</li>\n<li>No complex setup – just install and configure</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for WordPress sites where content management needs to be controlled without unnecessary complexity.</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed by <a href=\"https://stephanwagner.me\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stephan Wagner</a>.</p>\n",
